[00:23.48]Nations align as one,
[00:26.98]Opposing Jehovah’s Son.
[00:31.42]Their time of human rulership
[00:35.28]By God’s decree now is done.
[00:41.12]Rulers have had their day;
[00:45.04]God’s Kingdom is here to stay.
[00:49.54]Soon Christ will crush earthly enemies.
[00:53.76]No more will there be delay.
[00:58.49](Chorus)
[00:58.64]Seek God for your deliverance,
[01:02.84]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[01:07.66]Seek his righteousness,
[01:09.88]Show your faithfulness,
[01:12.16]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[01:16.76]Then see our God deliver you
[01:20.44]By his mighty hand.
[01:40.50]People on earth now choose,
[01:42.83]Responding to this good news.
[01:48.40]We offer to all men the choice
[01:52.84]To hear or proudly refuse.
[01:57.21]Trials, although severe,
[02:02.04]Need not fill our hearts with fear.
[02:06.64]Jehovah cares for his loyal ones;
[02:11.06]Our cries for help he will hear.
[02:15.19](Chorus)
[02:15.34]Seek God for your deliverance,
[02:19.78]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[02:24.68]Seek his righteousness,
[02:26.84]Show your faithfulness,
[02:29.14]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[02:33.62]Then see our God deliver you
[02:37.46]By his mighty hand.
